@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam Padding 0
title Analysis classes · UC07–UC08 Close cycle and release film
left to right direction
class "CycleClock\nBoundary" as ClockBoundary <<boundary>> $SAD
class "PrivateMedia\nBoundary" as MediaBoundary <<boundary>> $SAD
class CloseCycle <<control>> $CREAM
class CompileFilm <<control>> $CREAM
class PublishFilm <<control>> $CREAM
class Cycle <<entity>> {
  id: String
  endsAt: Instant
  status: CycleStatus
  releaseStatus: ReleaseStatus
}
class FilmJob <<entity>> {
  id: String
  status: JobStatus
  claimGeneration: Integer
}
class CompilationInput <<entity>> {
  position: Integer
}
class LifecycleEvent <<entity>> {
  transition: Transition
  occurredAt: Instant
}
ClockBoundary --> CloseCycle : boundary reached
ClockBoundary --> CompileFilm : work due
ClockBoundary --> PublishFilm : release due
CloseCycle --> Cycle : close / successor
CloseCycle --> FilmJob : schedule
CompileFilm --> FilmJob : claim / finalise
CompileFilm --> MediaBoundary : read / write
PublishFilm --> MediaBoundary : verify bytes
PublishFilm --> Cycle : publish / archive
Cycle "1" -- "0..1" FilmJob : compiled film
Cycle "1" -- "0..*" LifecycleEvent
FilmJob "1" -- "0..*" CompilationInput
legend bottom
Conceptual BCE responsibilities; mapped to implemented elements in a2d-cycle.
endlegend
@enduml
